<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p>travel-sync is used by its owner only. It accesses one Google Drive folder belonging to the owner to copy travel itinerary files to and from the owner's private home server.</p>
<p>No data is collected from anyone else, sold, shared with third parties, or used for advertising. Data stays in the owner's Google Drive and on the owner's server.</p>
